==About==
The '''Esports World Cup''' is a tournament series that was announced in late 2023, building off the previously established '''Gamers8''' series. '''CrossFire''' was announced as part of the line-up for 2025 on December 23, 2024.<ref name="EWC CF">{{Cite web|url=https://x.com/EWC_EN/status/1871103675055387064|title=The battle is on: #Crossfire joins the global stage at #EWC2025|date=2024-12-23|author=Esports World Cup|language={{Flag|usuk}} English}}</ref> The tournament will take the position of the [[CrossFire Stars Summer Championship]].
:''See [[esports:Esports_World_Cup/2025|here]] to read about the Esports World Cup 2025, the Calendar, the Club Standings and more.''

