===Format===
* '''Group Stage''' ''- August 19th - 21st''
** 4 Groups of 4 teams
** GSL format {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Top 2 of each group advances to '''Playoffs'''
* '''Playoffs''' ''- August 22nd - 23rd''
** Single-Elimination Bracket
** {{Abbr/Bo5}} Grand Final
** {{Abbr/Bo3}} Others

